      "value": "lol you can have whatever you want in a private world, its private for a reason. vrc's privacy is a mess though, devs can join on private worlds easily, but unless you're a streamer or someone popular that ain't gonna happen. unless they changed that, which i highly doubt. but i do agree to some degree, why have the nsfw tickbox if you \"aren't allowed to use it\". it wont stop anyone, but at this point its just a pointless textbox.",
